#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:2
msgid "CO₂の赤外スペクトル"
msgstr "Infrared Spectrum of CO₂"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"第一原理分子動力学で計算したCO₂分子の双極子モーメントの時間変化から、どの振動が赤外スペクトルに現れ、どの振動が現れないかを調べます。\\ "
"得られた振動数と赤外強度は、2つの計算手法（CPMDとBOMD）の間で比べ、実験値とも比べます。"
msgstr ""
"From the time evolution of the dipole moment of a CO₂ molecule calculated"
" with first-principles molecular dynamics, we determine which vibrations "
"appear in the infrared spectrum and which do not. \\ We compare the "
"resulting frequencies and IR intensities between two calculation methods "
"(CPMD and BOMD) and also with experimental values."

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:9
msgid ":doc:`計算結果を読む <ir_spectrum>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Interpreting the Calculation Results <ir_spectrum>`"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:10
msgid ":doc:`計算条件と再現手順 <reproduction>`"
msgstr ":doc:`Calculation Conditions and Reproduction Procedure <reproduction>`"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:14
msgid "CPMDで求めた双極子モーメントと振動座標のパワースペクトル"
msgstr "CPMD power spectra of the dipole moment and vibrational coordinates"

#: ../../co2_ir/index.rst:18
msgid ""
"CPMDで求めたパワースペクトル。対称伸縮振動のピークは、原子の座標から求めた振動座標のスペクトル（右）では1200〜1300 "
"cm⁻¹付近に現れますが、\\ 双極子モーメントのスペクトル（左）には見られません。\\ 対称伸縮振動が赤外不活性であることが分かります。"
msgstr ""
"Power spectra from CPMD. The symmetric stretching mode produces a peak "
"near 1200–1300 cm⁻¹ in the spectrum of the vibrational coordinate derived"
" from the atomic positions (right), \\ but no such peak appears in the "
"spectrum of the dipole moment (left). \\ This shows that the symmetric "
"stretching mode is IR inactive."

#~ msgid "第一原理分子動力学で得たCO₂分子の運動からスペクトルを求め、計算手法による違いと実験値を比較します。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "We obtain the infrared spectrum from "
#~ "the motion of a CO₂ molecule in"
#~ " first-principles molecular dynamics "
#~ "simulations, then compare the results "
#~ "across methods and with experimental "
#~ "values."

